Subject: [PATCH 21/42] hwcomposer: stop spamming about luts

10-12 15:02:16.070  1156  1180 E HWComposer: getLuts: getLuts failed for display 4630946253560767361: UNSUPPORTED (8)

Signed-off-by: Dmitrii <bankersenator@gmail.com>
---
 services/surfaceflinger/DisplayHardware/AidlComposerHal.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/services/surfaceflinger/DisplayHardware/AidlComposerHal.cpp b/services/surfaceflinger/DisplayHardware/AidlComposerHal.cpp
index 0ab9a4c..8a1a004 100644
--- a/services/surfaceflinger/DisplayHardware/AidlComposerHal.cpp
+++ b/services/surfaceflinger/DisplayHardware/AidlComposerHal.cpp
@@ -1748,7 +1748,7 @@ Error AidlComposer::getLuts(Display display, const std::vector<sp<GraphicBuffer>
     const auto status =
             mAidlComposerClient->getLuts(translate<int64_t>(display), aidlBuffers, luts);
     if (!status.isOk()) {
-        ALOGE("getLuts failed %s", status.getDescription().c_str());
+        ALOGD("getLuts failed %s", status.getDescription().c_str());
         return static_cast<Error>(status.getServiceSpecificError());
     }
 
